WEBVTT

00:04.180 --> 00:06.850
Hi there, and welcome to Cyberspace.

00:07.580 --> 00:11.270
I'm arkinox, and you may be wondering, what's going on around here?

00:11.910 --> 00:15.920
Well, Cyberspace is a completely decentralized metaverse.

00:15.920 --> 00:17.650
It's the first of its kind.

00:17.970 --> 00:22.190
There is no central authority that regulates how players interact with the space.

00:22.190 --> 00:25.800
The only regulation is mathematical computation.

00:25.900 --> 00:27.710
You might be wondering what this is.

00:28.220 --> 00:31.310
This is an avatar of a total noob.

00:38.790 --> 00:41.260
I look forward to seeing you around Cyberspace.

00:41.910 --> 00:43.740
Stay tuned for more helpful information.
